@model Rmv.Web.Pages.Shared.Flash
@*
    What a redirect-after-post has to say. Error first, always, because a page
    that reports both should lead with the thing that did not work.

    Four pages had their own copy of this pair of if blocks and two of them had
    drifted into showing them in the other order.
*@
@if (Model.Error is not null)
{
    <p class="notice" role="alert">@Model.Error</p>
}
@if (Model.Notice is not null)
{
    <p class="notice notice--ok" role="status">@Model.Notice</p>
}
